  description: '2 Level 9 monsters

    Once per Battle Step, during your opponent''s
    turn, if this card with Xyz Material is attacked: Negate the attack (this is
    a Quick Effect). When this card is targeted for an attack while it has no Xyz
    Materials: You can target 2 monsters in your Graveyard; attach those targets
    to this card as Xyz Materials. During your Main Phase 1: You can detach 1 Xyz
    Material from this card; this card can attack your opponent directly this turn.
    Your opponent must control a monster with higher ATK than this card for you to
    activate and to resolve this effect.'
